  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.3.0 adds linear and radial gradient fills, dashed strokes on ellipses, rounded rectangles, pie sectors, and arbitrary paths, rounded-rectangle paths, and clickable links, in-document links, bookmarks, and vector QR codes placed at canvas positions. It fixes VectorCanvas.Grid() drawing nothing and ShowIf(false) not hiding chained content. Full changelog: https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraPDF/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
